{"seq":4,"slug":"graph-metrics","title":"图的度量指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/network-science/graph-theory-basics/graph-metrics","wordCount":1453,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"图的度量指标\">图的度量指标</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>图的度量指标（Graph Metrics）是量化网络结构特征的数值工具。这些指标从不同角度描述了网络的全局特性（密度、直径）和局部特性（聚类系数、中心性），为比较不同网络、监控网络演化和指导架构设计提供了数据基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph 全局指标&#10;    A[密度] --&gt; E[连接稀疏/稠密]&#10;    B[直径] --&gt; F[最远节点距离]&#10;    C[平均路径长度] --&gt; G[信息传播效率]&#10;    D[平均聚类系数] --&gt; H[局部紧密度]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 节点指标&#10;    I[度中心性] --&gt; M[直接连接数]&#10;    J[介数中心性] --&gt; N[桥梁作用]&#10;    K[接近中心性] --&gt; O[到所有节点的距离]&#10;    L[特征向量中心性] --&gt; P[连接重要节点的程度]&#10;  end\">graph TD\n  subgraph 全局指标\n    A[密度] --&gt; E[连接稀疏/稠密]\n    B[直径] --&gt; F[最远节点距离]\n    C[平均路径长度] --&gt; G[信息传播效率]\n    D[平均聚类系数] --&gt; H[局部紧密度]\n  end\n  subgraph 节点指标\n    I[度中心性] --&gt; M[直接连接数]\n    J[介数中心性] --&gt; N[桥梁作用]\n    K[接近中心性] --&gt; O[到所有节点的距离]\n    L[特征向量中心性] --&gt; P[连接重要节点的程度]\n  end</pre><p>核心度量指标的定义和计算：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>计算复杂度</th>\n<th>软件系统含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>密度</td>\n<td>实际边数 / 可能最大边数</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>服务间耦合程度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直径</td>\n<td>所有最短路径的最大值</td>\n<td>[1, V-1]</td>\n<td>O(V(V+E))</td>\n<td>最长调用链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均路径长度</td>\n<td>所有点对最短路径的均值</td>\n<td>[1, 直径]</td>\n<td>O(V(V+E))</td>\n<td>平均调用深度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚类系数</td>\n<td>节点邻居之间的连接比例</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n<td>O(V·d²)</td>\n<td>服务组的内部凝聚度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>度中心性</td>\n<td>节点度 / (V-1)</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>直接依赖的广度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>介数中心性</td>\n<td>经过节点的最短路径比例</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n<td>O(V·E)</td>\n<td>节点的瓶颈程度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接近中心性</td>\n<td>到所有节点距离之和的倒数</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n<td>O(V(V+E))</td>\n<td>信息到达的效率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"密度与稀疏性\">密度与稀疏性</h2><p>网络密度 D = 2|E| / (|V|(|V|-1))（无向图）度量了实际连接占所有可能连接的比例。密度为 1 的网络是完全图（每对节点都连接），密度接近 0 的网络是稀疏网络。</p>\n<p>大多数真实世界的网络都是稀疏的。互联网的路由器网络、社交网络、代码依赖图的密度通常远小于 0.1。这种稀疏性有深刻的原因——维持每一条边都有成本（带宽、维护、认知负担），因此系统自然倾向于保持稀疏连接。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface GraphMetrics {&#10;  density: number;&#10;  diameter: number;&#10;  averagePathLength: number;&#10;  averageClusteringCoefficient: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const calculateDensity = &lt;V, E&gt;(graph: Graph&lt;V, E&gt;, directed: boolean = false): number =&gt; {&#10;  const v = graph.getVertices().length;&#10;  const e = graph.getEdgeCount();&#10;&#10;  if (v &lt;= 1) return 0;&#10;  const maxEdges = directed ? v * (v - 1) : (v * (v - 1)) / 2;&#10;  return e / maxEdges;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const interpretDensity = (density: number, vertexCount: number): { level: string; recommendation: string } =&gt; {&#10;  if (density &gt; 0.3) {&#10;    return {&#10;      level: &#39;高密度&#39;,&#10;      recommendation: &#39;考虑引入中间层（API 网关、事件总线）减少直接连接&#39;,&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;  if (density &gt; 0.1) {&#10;    return {&#10;      level: &#39;中等密度&#39;,&#10;      recommendation: &#39;监控关键路径，确保无不必要的直接依赖&#39;,&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;  return {&#10;    level: &#39;低密度&#39;,&#10;    recommendation: &#39;当前耦合度合理，确保连通性满足业务需求&#39;,&#10;  };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GraphMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  density</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  diameter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  averagePathLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  averageClusteringCoefficient</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateDensity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">E</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Graph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">E</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">directed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getVertices</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEdgeCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> maxEdges</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> directed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxEdges;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> interpretDensity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">density</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">vertexCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">recommendation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (density </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      level: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'高密度'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      recommendation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'考虑引入中间层（API 网关、事件总线）减少直接连接'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (density </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      level: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'中等密度'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      recommendation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'监控关键路径，确保无不必要的直接依赖'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    level: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'低密度'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    recommendation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'当前耦合度合理，确保连通性满足业务需求'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在微服务架构中，监控依赖图的密度变化趋势很有价值。密度持续上升可能表示服务间耦合在恶化——新增的服务倾向于直接调用已有服务而非通过抽象层。密度突然下降可能是因为引入了事件总线或 API 网关等间接通信方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚类系数\">聚类系数</h2><p>聚类系数（Clustering Coefficient）度量节点邻居之间的连接紧密程度。节点 v 的聚类系数 C(v) = 2T(v) / (k(v)(k(v)-1))，其中 T(v) 是 v 的邻居之间实际存在的边数，k(v) 是 v 的度。</p>\n<p>高聚类系数意味着&quot;你的朋友也是朋友&quot;——节点的邻居之间形成了紧密的群组。在软件系统中，高聚类系数的服务集群通常对应一个功能域（如订单域、支付域），域内服务交互频繁、紧密耦合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const clusteringCoefficient = &lt;V, E&gt;(graph: Graph&lt;V, E&gt;, nodeId: string): number =&gt; {&#10;  const neighbors = graph.getNeighbors(nodeId).map((n) =&gt; n.id);&#10;  const k = neighbors.length;&#10;&#10;  if (k &lt; 2) return 0;&#10;&#10;  let triangles = 0;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; neighbors.length; i++) {&#10;    for (let j = i + 1; j &lt; neighbors.length; j++) {&#10;      if (graph.hasEdge(neighbors[i], neighbors[j]) || graph.hasEdge(neighbors[j], neighbors[i])) {&#10;        triangles++;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return (2 * triangles) / (k * (k - 1));&#10;};&#10;&#10;const averageClusteringCoefficient = &lt;V, E&gt;(graph: Graph&lt;V, E&gt;): number =&gt; {&#10;  const vertices = graph.getVertices();&#10;  const total = vertices.reduce((sum, v) =&gt; sum + clusteringCoefficient(graph, v), 0);&#10;  return total / vertices.length;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> clusteringCoefficient</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">E</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Graph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">E</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nodeId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> neighbors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getNeighbors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nodeId).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span>