\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      area: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'耦合度'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'⚠️ 高密度'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'审查是否有不必要的直接依赖'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (metrics.maxDegree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    findings.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      area: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'核心服务'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'⚠️ 度过高'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'考虑拆分或引入代理层'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (metrics.topBetweenness[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]?.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    findings.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      area: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'瓶颈风险'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'🔴 高介数节点'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'该服务需要冗余部署和熔断保护'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> findings;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>建议的架构指标监控面板应包含：密度趋势（月度变化）、Top-10 度中心性服务、Top-5 介数中心性服务（瓶颈预警）、聚类分析（识别功能域边界）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>网络密度度量整体耦合程度，密度持续上升是架构耦合恶化的信号</li>\n<li>聚类系数度量邻居间的紧密程度，高聚类区域通常对应功能域</li>\n<li>度中心性、介数中心性和接近中心性分别衡量连接广度、桥梁作用和传播效率</li>\n<li>低度高介数的节点是最需要冗余设计的关键桥梁</li>\n<li>将图指标纳入持续监控可以建立架构健康度的定量评估体系</li>\n<li>综合多种指标才能全面评估节点在网络中的角色和风险</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图的度量指标","id":"图的度量指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"密度与稀疏性","id":"密度与稀疏性"},{"level":2,"text":"聚类系数","id":"聚类系数"},{"level":2,"text":"中心性分析","id":"中心性分析"},{"level":2,"text":"度量指标的实践应用","id":"度量指标的实践应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/network-science/graph-theory-basics/graph-algorithms"},"next":{"title":"小世界网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties/small-world"}}